The `cesium-i3s-build-worker` CLI (worker/build-worker.mjs) bundles the above
patched decodeI3S.js against the consumer's own installed @cesium/engine
(https://github.com/CesiumGS/cesium) sources at build time. The resulting
decodeI3S.js worker output therefore also includes CesiumJS engine sources,
Copyright 2011-2022 Cesium Contributors, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

The bundled worker output also includes draco3d (https://github.com/google/draco),
